    "body": "I think the difference could technically be observable with mutation events, since this changes the timing a bit? But, thankfully, mutation events are dead. So this is probably correct.\r\n\r\n(Also, I suspect this matches implementations and the original intention of the spec better. I'm just trying to tease out whether we could write a web platform test for this, or if there's a possibility of browser divergence here.)\r\n\r\nI'll give this a day in case anyone else wants to double-check my logic. (Maybe @domfarolino in particular since he was looking at this area recently.)",
